{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Expand your fleet</strong> by <strong>raiding other spaceships</strong> in this <strong>action packed space-themed shooter</strong> with both <strong>First-Person &amp; Spaceship Combat</strong> or <strong>explore galaxies</strong> noone has been before...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1956850/extras/Testt.png?t=1744710165\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1956850/extras/ProjectMind03-APNG01.png?t=1744710165\" />Destroy the aldions` spaceships before they harm your fleet...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1956850/extras/ExpandYOurFleet.png?t=1744710165\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1956850/extras/ProjectMind02-APNG01.png?t=1744710165\" />Find a way into hostile motherships and <strong>scavange WEAPONS</strong>,\u00a0<strong>PERKS\u00a0</strong>or<strong> PARTS</strong>\u00a0to build own\u00a0<i><strong>SPACESHIPS</strong></i>... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1956850/extras/UseYourGadtes.png?t=1744710165\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1956850/extras/ProjectMind04-APNG01.png?t=1744710165\" />Reclaim implants to <strong>unlock new ABILITIES</strong> or get protection by<strong>  your SHIELD</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1956850/extras/ExplorePlanets.png?t=1744710165\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1956850/extras/ProjectMind01-APNG09.png?t=1744710165\" />Need a brake from destroying Aldions? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just launch your spaceship and discover galaxies noone has been before...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ABOUT PROJECT MIND:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The scientific project develops implants which improve your mind in certain aspects. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The aldions consider this project a unnatural, dangerous venture and try everything to cancle it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">That\u2019s why they infiltrate the spaceship of project mind and steal all data and implants necessary to keep the project alive...</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1956850?t=1744710165","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1956850?t=1744710165","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1956850/41cc839e1f2de3f81ac4824afc0d46be4ffb5e48/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744710165","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1956850/41cc839e1f2de3f81ac4824afc0d46be4ffb5e48/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744710165","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Expand your fleet</strong> by <strong>raiding other spaceships</strong> in this <strong>action packed space-themed shooter</strong> with both <strong>First-Person &amp; Spaceship Combat</strong> or <strong>explore galaxies</strong> noone has been before...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st